{"hierarchy":{"paths":[["doc:\/\/IvorModel\/documentation\/IvorModel","doc:\/\/IvorModel\/documentation\/IvorModel\/PanMap"]]},"kind":"symbol","metadata":{"role":"symbol","symbolKind":"method","modules":[{"name":"IvorModel"}],"fragments":[{"text":"func","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" ","kind":"text"},{"text":"move","kind":"identifier"},{"text":"(","kind":"text"},{"text":"entryID","kind":"externalParam"},{"text":": ","kind":"text"},{"text":"EntryID","kind":"typeIdentifier","preciseIdentifier":"s:9IvorModel7EntryIDV"},{"text":", ","kind":"text"},{"text":"to","kind":"externalParam"},{"text":": ","kind":"text"},{"text":"TimeType","kind":"typeIdentifier","preciseIdentifier":"s:9IvorModel6PanMapV8TimeTypexmfp"},{"text":") -> ","kind":"text"},{"preciseIdentifier":"s:9IvorModel7EntryIDV","text":"EntryID","kind":"typeIdentifier"},{"text":"?","kind":"text"}],"externalID":"s:9IvorModel6PanMapV4move7entryID2toAA05EntryG0VSgAH_xtF","roleHeading":"Instance Method","conformance":{"constraints":[{"code":"TimeType","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":" conforms to ","type":"text"},{"code":"TimeProtocol","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":".","type":"text"}],"conformancePrefix":[{"text":"Conforms when","type":"text"}],"availabilityPrefix":[{"text":"Available when","type":"text"}]},"title":"move(entryID:to:)","extendedModule":"IvorModel"},"abstract":[{"text":"Moves the pan entry with the given identity to a new time, keeping","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"its pan position and extras, and re-sorts it into place.","type":"text"}],"primaryContentSections":[{"kind":"declarations","declarations":[{"platforms":["macOS"],"tokens":[{"text":"@discardableResult","kind":"attribute"},{"kind":"text","text":" "},{"text":"mutating","kind":"keyword"},{"kind":"text","text":" "},{"text":"func","kind":"keyword"},{"kind":"text","text":" "},{"text":"move","kind":"identifier"},{"kind":"text","text":"("},{"text":"entryID","kind":"externalParam"},{"text":": ","kind":"text"},{"preciseIdentifier":"s:9IvorModel7EntryIDV","identifier":"doc:\/\/IvorModel\/documentation\/IvorModel\/EntryID","text":"EntryID","kind":"typeIdentifier"},{"text":", ","kind":"text"},{"text":"to","kind":"externalParam"},{"text":" ","kind":"text"},{"text":"time","kind":"internalParam"},{"text":": ","kind":"text"},{"text":"TimeType","kind":"typeIdentifier","preciseIdentifier":"s:9IvorModel6PanMapV8TimeTypexmfp"},{"text":") -> ","kind":"text"},{"text":"EntryID","kind":"typeIdentifier","identifier":"doc:\/\/IvorModel\/documentation\/IvorModel\/EntryID","preciseIdentifier":"s:9IvorModel7EntryIDV"},{"text":"?","kind":"text"}],"languages":["swift"]}]},{"parameters":[{"name":"entryID","content":[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"The identity of the entry to move."}]}]},{"name":"time","content":[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"The new time for the entry."}]}]}],"kind":"parameters"},{"kind":"content","content":[{"text":"Return Value","anchor":"return-value","type":"heading","level":2},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"The identity that now addresses this entry’s content — "},{"code":"entryID","type":"codeVoice"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"itself, unless the move merged it into a pre-existing exact"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"duplicate, in which case the survivor’s identity. "},{"code":"nil","type":"codeVoice"},{"type":"text","text":" if"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"code":"entryID","type":"codeVoice"},{"type":"text","text":" did not identify any entry and nothing moved."}]}]},{"kind":"content","content":[{"text":"Discussion","anchor":"discussion","type":"heading","level":2},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Unlike "},{"isActive":true,"type":"reference","identifier":"doc:\/\/IvorModel\/documentation\/IvorModel\/PanMap\/update(entryID:pan:extras:)"},{"type":"text","text":", this is expected to reorder"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"entries — that is the point of editing the time itself. Two entries"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"legitimately ending up at the same time (see"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"isActive":true,"type":"reference","identifier":"doc:\/\/IvorModel\/documentation\/IvorModel\/PanMap\/insert(time:pan:extras:)"},{"type":"text","text":" for the discontinuity use case) is not"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"treated as a collision to reject; the moved entry simply takes its"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"place among any others already there, exactly as a fresh insertion"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"would."}]},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"The one case where "},{"code":"entryID","type":"codeVoice"},{"type":"text","text":" stops identifying the moved entry afterward is"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"when the move lands it exactly on top of another entry already"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"present — same time, pan position, and extras — the same"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"exact-duplicate case "},{"isActive":true,"type":"reference","identifier":"doc:\/\/IvorModel\/documentation\/IvorModel\/PanMap\/insert(time:pan:extras:)"},{"type":"text","text":" silently collapses."},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"There, the moved entry merges into that pre-existing one instead of"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"being kept separately, so "},{"code":"entryID","type":"codeVoice"},{"type":"text","text":" no longer names anything in the map;"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"the returned identity is the survivor’s instead, which a caller must"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"switch to addressing from then on."}]}]}],"schemaVersion":{"minor":3,"major":0,"patch":0},"sections":[],"variants":[{"paths":["\/documentation\/ivormodel\/panmap\/move(entryid:to